{"case_id": "multimodal-h01", "dimension": "multimodal", "tier": "hard", "tags": [], "prompt": "外径 50 mm、长 100 mm 的实心圆柱，求体积（cm³，保留一位小数）。", "gold": {"answer": "DIA50; L100；196.3"}, "max_tokens": 704, "response": "好的，我们来计算一个外径为50毫米、长为100毫米的实心圆柱的体积。\n\n---\n\n**已知条件：**\n- 外径 $ D = 50 $ mm\n- 长度 $ L = 100 $ mm\n\n**要求：** 体积 $ V $，单位为立方厘米（cm³），保留一位小数。\n\n---\n\n**步骤 1：计算圆柱的体积公式**\n\n实心圆柱的体积公式为：\n$$ V = \\pi r^2 h $$\n其中：\n- $ r $ 是圆柱的半径\n- $ h $ 是圆柱的高（或长度）\n\n---\n\n**步骤 2：将尺寸单位统一**\n\n将毫米（mm）转换为米（m），以便于计算，但最终结果需要是 cm³，所以我们可以直接用 mm 计算，然后换算。\n\n- $ D = 50 $ mm，所以半径 $ r = \\frac{50}{2} = 25 $ mm\n- $ L = 100 $ mm\n\n---\n\n**步骤 3：代入公式计算**\n\n$$ V = \\pi \\times (25 \\text{ mm})^2 \\times 100 \\text{ mm} $$\n$$ V = \\pi \\times 625 \\text{ mm}^2 \\times 100 \\text{ mm} $$\n$$ V = \\pi \\times 62500 \\text{ mm}^3 $$\n$$ V = 62500\\pi \\text{ mm}^3 $$\n\n现在计算数值：\n$$ V \\approx 62500 \\times 3.1415926535 $$\n$$ V \\approx 196349.53 \\text{ mm}^3 $$\n\n---\n\n**步骤 4：换算为 cm³**\n\n因为 $ 1 \\text{ mm} = 0.1 \\text{ cm} $，所以：\n$$ 1 \\text{ mm}^3 = (0.1 \\text{ cm})^3 = 0.001 \\text{ cm}^3 $$\n所以：\n$$ V = 196349.53 \\text{ mm}^3 = 196349.53 \\times 0.001 \\text{ cm}^3 $$\n$$ V \\approx 196.34953 \\text{ cm}^3 $$\n\n---\n\n**步骤 5：保留一位小数**\n\n$$ V \\approx 196.3 \\text{ cm}^3 $$\n\n---\n\n**答案：**\n$$ \\boxed{196.3} \\text{ cm}^3 $$", "reasoning": null, "score": 50.0, "criteria": [{"key": "读图", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "missing=['DIA50', 'L100']"}, {"key": "体积", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=196.3 target=196.3 tol=3.926 all=[50.0, 100.0, 50.0, 100.0, 3.0, 1.0, 2.0, 2.0]"}], "verdict": "partial", "gen": {"elapsed_s": 75.718, "prompt_tokens": 260, "completion_tokens": 601, "finish_reason": "stop", "peak_vram_gb": 1.61, "error": null, "arm": "Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct", "n_images": 1}}
{"case_id": "multimodal-h02", "dimension": "multimodal", "tier": "hard", "tags": [], "prompt": "按图中参数求主轴转速 n（r/min，保留一位小数）。", "gold": {"answer": "Vc 80; DIA50；509.3"}, "max_tokens": 704, "response": "根据图中参数，已知：\n- $ V_c = 80 $ mm/rev\n- $ D = 50 $ mm\n\n主轴转速 $ n $（r/min）的计算公式为：\n$$\nn = \\frac{1000 \\times V_c}{\\pi \\times D}\n$$\n\n代入数值：\n$$\nn = \\frac{1000 \\times 80}{\\pi \\times 50} = \\frac{80000}{157.08} \\approx 510.0 \\, \\text{r/min}\n$$\n\n保留一位小数，结果为：\n$$\nn = 510.0 \\, \\text{r/min}\n$$\n\n答案：$ \\boxed{510.0} $ r/min", "reasoning": null, "score": 50.0, "criteria": [{"key": "读图", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "missing=['Vc 80', 'DIA50']"}, {"key": "转速", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=510.0 target=509.3 tol=10.186 all=[80.0, 50.0, 1000.0, 1000.0, 80.0, 50.0, 80000.0, 157.08]"}], "verdict": "partial", "gen": {"elapsed_s": 17.862, "prompt_tokens": 249, "completion_tokens": 179, "finish_reason": "stop", "peak_vram_gb": 1.61, "error": null, "arm": "Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct", "n_images": 1}}
{"case_id": "multimodal-h03", "dimension": "multimodal", "tier": "hard", "tags": [], "prompt": "求图中零件的壁厚（mm）。", "gold": {"answer": "DIA53; DIA14; L45；19.5"}, "max_tokens": 704, "response": "根据您提供的图片，图中显示了三个代码：\n\n- DIA53\n- DIA14\n- L45\n\n这些代码通常用于标识零件的尺寸或类型。其中：\n\n- “DIA” 是直径（Diameter）的缩写。\n- “L” 是长度（Length）的缩写。\n\n因此，这些代码代表了零件的尺寸：\n\n- DIA53：直径为53毫米。\n- DIA14：直径为14毫米。\n- L45：长度为45毫米。\n\n然而，您要求的是“壁厚（mm）”，即零件的壁厚。但图中并未提供任何关于壁厚的信息，例如零件的厚度、材料厚度或任何与壁厚相关的尺寸。\n\n因此，无法从图中求出零件的壁厚。\n\n**答案：** 无法求出图中零件的壁厚，因为图中没有提供足够的信息来计算壁厚。", "reasoning": null, "score": 50.0, "criteria": [{"key": "读图", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "all present (3)"}, {"key": "壁厚", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=14.0 target=19.5 tol=0.39 all=[53.0, 14.0, 45.0, 53.0, 53.0, 14.0, 14.0, 45.0]"}], "verdict": "partial", "gen": {"elapsed_s": 22.731, "prompt_tokens": 240, "completion_tokens": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "peak_vram_gb": 1.61, "error": null, "arm": "Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct", "n_images": 1}}
